<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\栄一郎マンション外廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\栄一郎布団.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"I'm home, <STYLE ID="1">Eiichiro-san</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, welcome home, </STYLE>Mifuyu-san<STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE><PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\昼の月.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"Hehe, this feels a little embarrassing... 
{PAUSE ""}
I just went and told <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> we're getting married."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I see..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What's wrong?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, it's just... </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> marrying me means you'll be tied to my family back home, too..."</STYLE><PG>
"The Arata settlement, right? It's all right. I know I'll have to go through a hard trial for a year, too."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I called </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> earlier. I told her I'd be bringing the person I want to marry. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And then..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Did she... object?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No, she said she's really happy I found someone like that. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It's just... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">this is something I only heard for the first time just now myself..."</STYLE><PG>
"Okay..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Mifuyu-san<STYLE ID="1">... maybe we shouldn't get married after all―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Eiichiro-san</STYLE>, first, please tell me what this is about. 
{PAUSE ""}
You can't carry it all by <STYLE ID="1">yourself</STYLE>."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"You're... right... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But... I think it's a really unpleasant story... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So, um... I'd like you to brace yourself before you hear it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"All right."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"The old people, they commit suicide."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Suicide?"<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"When the residents of the Arata settlement turn 75, they all commit suicide in April."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Um... why is that...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> doesn't know why either... no, she said nobody knows why... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I do remember old people dying suddenly once every few years, but I never dreamed it was suicide..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"So... about the marriage, maybe after all―"</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Eiichiro-san</STYLE>, people die sooner or later. 
{PAUSE ""}
I used to be conservative and timid, and I've already put an end to that kind of life. 
{PAUSE ""}
So I'm not afraid. 
{PAUSE ""}
What scares me far more is growing old after losing <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Mifuyu-san<STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Besides, if you know it's 75, then life's goal is easy to see. Isn't that a good thing? 
{PAUSE ""}
Rather than not knowing when you'll die, I think that way you can live life to the fullest."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
"And since <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> and I are the same age, I feel like getting to end our lives at the same time wouldn't be so bad... 
{PAUSE ""}
Is that a strange way to think...?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Uuu..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Eiichiro-san</STYLE>...?"<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Code_of_Honor_#2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Sniff... For </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> to say something like that to me... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Here I am, the only one who's scared. It's pathetic..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Heh heh heh, it's all right. With <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>, I'm not afraid of anything. 
{PAUSE ""}
So please stay with me for a little over 50 more years, okay?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Uuu... yes..."</STYLE><PG>
"Oh, but there's just one thing I don't understand... 
{PAUSE ""}
Are the people who commit suicide the ones from the Arata settlement, or the ones living in the Arata settlement? Which is it?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Um, which would it be... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I don't know that much yet, so I'll ask </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> later."</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
